            {
              "id": "1781328944489_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Give a multiRecordWidget list of products based on the data {{$context.$nodes.RECOMMEND_TOP_3_PRODUCTS.$output.result}} show the products list of productNames in list.\n\nFor each product please invoke the command show the arrow mark at end of window.\naction: ora.Invoke(navigateToMarketingStrategyAdvisory,{\"parentProductId\":\"<productId>\",\"parentProductName\":\"<productName>\"})\nTitle: Select a Product Family to continue to Marketing Command Center\nTitle should be bold and atleast bigger that normal text 2x times.\n<productId>: {{$context.$nodes.RECOMMEND_TOP_3_PRODUCTS.$output.result.productId}}\n<productName>: {{$context.$nodes.RECOMMEND_TOP_3_PRODUCTS.$output.result.productName}}\n\n#**Strictly: Only show productName which are clickable and perform the above action for each product."
            }
          ],
