              "value": "Give a multiRecordWidget list of products :{{$context.$nodes.PRODUCT_LIST_FILTER.$output.items}}\n\nFor each product please invoke the command show the arrow mark at end of window.\naction: ora.Invoke(navigateToMarketingStrategyAdvisory,{\"parentProductId\":\"<productId>\",\"parentProductName\":\"<productName>\"})\n\n<productId>: {{$context.$nodes.PRODUCT_LIST_FILTER.$output.result.productId}}\n<productName>: {{$context.$nodes.PRODUCT_LIST_FILTER.$output.result.productName}}\n\n**Strictly: Don't include the artifactCode, templateName and other summary or description or any other text. Only show the product name's as clickable action items and no table.\nDon't give assumptions of product names without data in {{$context.$nodes.PRODUCT_LIST_FILTER.$output.items}}\n\n\nFinally give me the filtered list of productNames which is clickable. No other text and list should be shown."
            }
